# 📘 The 2025 AI-Agent .gitignore Rule Book

# 🛡️ Rule 1: Silence the Agent’s "Drafts"
.agent_logs/
**/artifacts/
**/plans/
claude-progress.txt

# 📸 Rule 2: Ignore "Visual Proof"
**/*.mov
**/*.mp4
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
.antigravity/

# 🏗️ Rule 3: Sandbox Hygiene (Worktrees & Temp Folders)
.worktrees/
temp_env/
.scratch/

# 🧠 Rule 4: The "Keep It Smart" Exception (What NOT to Ignore)
!/.github/copilot-instructions.md
!/.cursorrules
!/.trae/rules/*.md
!/.windsurf/instructions.yaml

# 🔑 Rule 5: Zero-Trust for "Generated Secrets"
.env*
!.env.example

# General Project Ignores
/node_modules/
/vendor/
/build/
*.zip
*.log
.DS_Store
.vscode/
.idea/
# Lock files tracked for reproducible builds
# composer.lock
# package-lock.json
playwright-report/
test-results/

# Debug artifacts (prevent tracking debug files)
phpunit_debug.log
debug_capture
**/debug_*.log
*_debug.log
